      {
        "author_name": "A Ksr",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112118075245789188601/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXeuH7MVHbAkIi-NcZxXytiivIb_K9_X22FmdLSfm7BRJTPM0wE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Beautiful arena, open year round for family fun.",
        "time": 1582749582,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jason Hutch",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111556831398864593876/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVoi4X-DMeu-Nc8r-nod6BhgeksRUTJ6Qf6X9tJiePoXZtPZW0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We decided to go skating.  My daughter's and I.  The free skate is available on Sundays between 16h15 and 17h50 so a nice amount of time.  As we were walking to the changing rooms, the Zamboni was cleaning the ice.  Changing rooms are as expected, bench, hooks and shelf.  Ice condition was fantastic and they have a monitor on the ice at all times (which came in handy as my oldest fell and got winded a little).  Monitor helped her up and had her sit in the penalty box (lol) until she regained her composure and went back out on the ice.  All in all a great experience.  Price is right as well for outsiders to Vaudreuil.  2.50$ for adults and 1.50$ for children 13 and under.  Not too harsh on the budget.  Will definitely make this our go to for the rest of this skating season.",
        "time": 1707224788,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marvin Matos",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110673890626214524512/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWfwYhB4TNg2jYTtkZsFkIzTe2TBfZTG8osvMU0NL0a7-Y_LQA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Really impressed by this arena. From its clean changing rooms to its crisp ice, and the pro shop is very conveniently located near the changing rooms making sharpening your skates even more efficient!",
        "time": 1710970572,
        "translated": false
      }
